                <mxCell id="n1803" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EventProposalVersion.approvedBudget(): domain approvedBudget(this.budgetLines, decided)&lt;br&gt;(one amount per line, whole and &amp;gt;= 0, &amp;lt;= requested, a reduced line needs a reason)&lt;br&gt;EventReviewDecision.nextEventState(): Approve -&amp;gt; Approved, Reject -&amp;gt; Rejected,&lt;br&gt;Re-defense -&amp;gt; Re-defense Pending, Request revision -&amp;gt; Revision Requested&lt;br&gt;(a rejected reschedule also runs cancelEventInSession)&lt;br&gt;EventBudgetSummary.applyApproval(): applyProposalDecisionInSession() - creates or updates&lt;br&gt;eventBudgets; a disbursed budget cannot change and approvedTotal &amp;gt;= disbursedTotal&lt;br&gt;EventDefenseSession.isActive(): domain hasActiveDefense()&lt;br&gt;(SCHEDULED, CONFIRMED, RESCHEDULE_REQUESTED, IN_PROGRESS)&lt;br&gt;mongo decide() runs applyProposalDecisionInSession(requireDefendedSession = false):&lt;br&gt;an active defense blocks Approve / Reject / Re-defense; a revision deadline must be&lt;br&gt;at least 12 h before the defense; Re-defense needs a DEFENDED session without outcome&lt;br&gt;(then a new Open task for the same officer)" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="190" width="520" x="1360" y="540" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
