                <mxCell id="n5160" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ReportInput.normalize(): domain normalizeReport() (actualResult required, &amp;lt;= 20 HTTPS evidence links)&lt;br&gt;ReportObligation.assertSubmittable(): domain assertReportSubmission(state, attendanceFinalized, ...)&lt;br&gt;(public event Completed &amp; attendance finalized; internal MEMBERS_ONLY skips post-event report)&lt;br&gt;ReportDetail.latest(): versions[0] (newest version, used by act())&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport.save(): mongo act(&amp;quot;save&amp;quot;) - edits the Draft, or opens version n+1&lt;br&gt;after &amp;quot;Returned for correction&amp;quot;; a Submitted/Accepted version is immutable&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport.submit(): act(&amp;quot;submit&amp;quot;) - Draft -&amp;gt; Submitted, figures frozen,&lt;br&gt;lateFlag = now &amp;gt; dueAt, event -&amp;gt; Report Submitted&lt;br&gt;reportState: enum in infra/db/ucms-schema.generated.ts" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
